    <panel_attributes>title=SD10 Goal-Driven Agent Run with Planning, Human Approval, Replanning and Undo (F16 / UC16)
obj=Student~Student ACTOR
obj=:AgentWorkspacePage~AWP
obj=:AgentAPI~AAPI
obj=:TaskQueue~TQ
obj=:BackgroundWorker~BW
obj=:AgentController~AC
obj=:MemoryManager~MM
obj=:ContextBuilder~CB
obj=:Planner~PL
obj=:PlaybookLibrary~PB
obj=:LLMClient~LLM
obj=:Plan~P
obj=:ToolManager~TM
obj=:ApprovalPolicy~AP
obj=:AgentRun~RUN
obj=:AgentCommand~CMD
obj=:Reasoner~RS

Student-&gt;&gt;&gt;AWP : 1: submitGoal("Prepare my\napplication for the Acme\nbackend co-op")
AWP-&gt;&gt;&gt;AAPI : 2: startRun(req); on=AAPI
AAPI-&gt;&gt;&gt;TQ : 3: enqueue("agent_run",\n{userId, goal:\nPREPARE_APPLICATION})
AAPI.&gt;AWP : 4: 202 {runId}; off=AAPI
TQ-&gt;&gt;&gt;BW : 5: runTask("agent_run",\nargs)
BW-&gt;&gt;&gt;AC : 6: runGoal(userId, goal); on=AC
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;MM : 7: recall(userId,\ngoal.description,\n[EPISODIC, PREFERENCE,\nFEEDBACK], 10); on=MM
MM.&gt;AC : 8: relevant memories; off=MM
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;CB : 9: buildCandidateContext(userId, job); on=CB
CB.&gt;AC : 10: ctx; off=CB
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;TM : 11: listTools(); on=TM
TM.&gt;AC : 12: ToolSpecs; off=TM
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;PL : 13: createPlan(goal, ctx, tools); on=PL
PL-&gt;&gt;&gt;LLM : 14: generateStructured("agent.plan", vars,\nplanSchema, userId); on=LLM
LLM.&gt;PL : 15: steps; off=LLM
PL-&gt;&gt;&gt;PL + : 16:\nvalidate\nPlan(plan,\ntools)
tick=1
combinedFragment=opt~f1 PL PB; PL:[invalid twice]
PL-&gt;&gt;&gt;PB : 17: getPlaybook(PREPARE_APPLICATION); on=PB
PB.&gt;PL : 18: fallback plan; off=PB
--=f1
PL.&gt;AC : 19: Plan: SearchJobs -&gt; RetrieveContext -&gt;\nAnalyzeJob -&gt; MatchJob -&gt;\nBuildPackage* -&gt;\nUpdateApplicationStatus*; off=PL
text=P:* side-effecting steps\nrequire approval
combinedFragment=loop~f2 Student RS; AWP:[while plan.hasNext() and\nrun.withinBudget() and\nstepCount &lt; 8]
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;P : 20: nextStep(); on=P
P.&gt;AC : 21: step; off=P
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;TM : 22: createCommand(step, run); on=TM
TM.&gt;AC : 23: cmd; off=TM
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;AP : 24: requiresApproval(cmd); on=AP
AP.&gt;AC : 25: needsApproval; off=AP
combinedFragment=opt~f3 Student RS; AWP:[needsApproval]
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;RUN : 26: awaitApproval(step)
text=RUN:run persisted as\nAWAITING_APPROVAL\;\nworker is released
AWP-&gt;&gt;&gt;AAPI : 27: getRun(req, runId); on=AAPI
AAPI.&gt;AWP : 28: pending step +\ncmd.describe(); off=AAPI
Student-&gt;&gt;&gt;AWP : 29: approveStep(runId, true)
AWP-&gt;&gt;&gt;AAPI : 30: approveStep(req, runId); on=AAPI
AAPI-&gt;&gt;&gt;AC : 31: resumeRun(runId, approved)
AAPI.&gt;AWP : 32: 202; off=AAPI
combinedFragment=alt~f4 AC RS; MM:[student rejects the step]
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;RS : 33: evaluate(run, step, obs)
text=RS:rejection is an\nobservation\;\nReasoner returns REPLAN\nor FINISH
--=f4
--=f3
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;TM : 34: execute(cmd); on=TM
TM-&gt;&gt;&gt;CMD : 35: execute(); on=CMD
CMD.&gt;TM : 36: Observation; off=CMD
TM.&gt;AC : 37: Observation (AgentActionRecord\npersisted); off=TM
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;RUN : 38: recordObservation(obs)
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;RS : 39: evaluate(run, step, obs); on=RS
RS.&gt;AC : 40: Decision; off=RS
combinedFragment=alt~f5 AC RUN; MM:[ASK_USER (e.g.\nSearchJobs found two\n"Acme" postings)]
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;RUN : 41: awaitApproval(step)
text=RUN:GUI asks which posting\;\nanswer resumes run
..=f5; MM:[REPLAN and replanCount &lt;\n2]
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;PL : 42: replan(run, obs); on=PL
PL-&gt;&gt;&gt;P : 43: replaceRemaining(steps)
PL.&gt;AC : 44: Plan; off=PL
..=f5; MM:[ABORT (budget / repeated\ntool failure)]
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;RUN : 45: fail(reason)
--=f5
--=f2
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;AC + : 46:\nfinish(run)
tick=1
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;MM : 47: remember(userId,\nEPISODIC, "prepared\npackage for Acme backend\nco-op", runId)
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;RUN : 48: complete(summary); off=AC
text=Student:--- undo a reversible\nagent action ---
Student-&gt;&gt;&gt;AWP : 49: undoAction(recordId)
AWP-&gt;&gt;&gt;AAPI : 50: undoAction(req,\nrecordId); on=AAPI
AAPI-&gt;&gt;&gt;TM : 51: undo(recordId); on=TM
TM-&gt;&gt;&gt;CMD : 52: undo()
text=CMD:UpdateApplicationStatusCommand.undo()\n-&gt;\nApplicationService.undoTransition()
TM.&gt;AAPI : 53: ok; off=TM
AAPI.&gt;AWP : 54: 200 OK; off=AAPI
</panel_attributes>
